    "content": "<h3>Patient-Rated Wrist Evaluation (PRWE)</h3>\n<div class=\"excel-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"excel-table\" data-calc-group=\"prwe\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width: 42%;\"><span class=\"th-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">Section / Item Description</span><div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 28%;\"><span class=\"th-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">Response Scale / Range</span><div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 14%;\" class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"th-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">Patient Score</span><div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n        <th style=\"width: 16%;\"><span class=\"th-text\" contenteditable=\"true\">Notes / Cutoff</span><div class=\"col-resizer\"></div></th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>1. Pain Subscale (5 items: rest, repeated, lifting, worst, frequency)</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: No pain to 10: Worst (Max 50)</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"prwe-pain\" min=\"0\" max=\"50\" value=\"0\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Pain Max 50</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>2. Function: Specific Tasks (6 items: doorknob, jar, zipper, push-up, carry, bathroom)</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: No difficulty to 10: Unable</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"prwe-fn\" min=\"0\" max=\"60\" value=\"0\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Specific Tasks</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>3. Function: Usual Activities (4 items: personal care, chores, work, recreation)</td><td class=\"text-slate-500\">0: No difficulty to 10: Unable</td><td><input type=\"number\" class=\"excel-input\" data-group=\"prwe-fn\" min=\"0\" max=\"40\" value=\"0\" /></td><td><span class=\"risk-pill risk-neutral\">Usual Activities</span></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"excel-total-row\">\n        <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"font-bold\">\n          Total Score [Pain + (Function/2)]: <span class=\"excel-sum font-mono\" data-sum-target=\"prwe\">0</span> &bull; \n          Max Score: <span class=\"font-mono\">100</span> &bull; \n          % Impairment: <span class=\"excel-percent font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\" data-percent-target=\"prwe\" data-max=\"100\">0%</span>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"text-center font-mono font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\">\n          <span class=\"excel-sum\" data-sum-target=\"prwe\">0</span>\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          <span class=\"risk-pill risk-low\">MCID: 11.5 pts</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>"
